{"v":3,"catch":"用球擊碎磚塊。","desc":"獲得獎勵、速度提升和多球等道具，讓遊戲更具挑戰性。多次擊中力場牆即可摧毀，從而進入下一關。如果漏接一個球，則會回到上一關。但要抓緊時間，球爆炸前只有幾秒鐘的時間。\n\n《氡氣爆破》包含大量隨機排列的關卡。提升球速會讓遊戲更具挑戰性。在關卡之間跳躍，收集獎勵倍率，以獲得更高分數。","publisher":"EntwicklerX","release":"2026-09-03","genres":["街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ff11637957862824929ce57742826e01ca1a427c2a1e0b4c52a62abce0da0a8b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fe4b7ee4cf8455e781b9b80944d39df91c285fbbfbe46553f6f5c496b89ee48d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/799f89dd35e67c15c2a58309219d408113218e5f2d769c7076e37e063242f907.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cf37d7ae423d587812b436a4a5e8f4719431a9a763de42942db6bd334ff6bd37.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/36cae813c43aecfbe2328a5abf18c3c7030d6cb5dd85781c0a5388895b593bfe.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/72736576e21497a5ea3c26744987bd9fbe71eefd885930890207bcc0b1852a18.jpg"],"titleId":"0100323014580000","dlc":[]}